---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base>
  {/* ════════════════ HERO ════════════════ */}
  <section class="border-b border-ink/10">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 md:py-32">
      <p class="font-mono text-sm text-muted mb-6">
        <span class="text-electric">$</span> ./citebeam --help
      </p>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted mb-4">
        ## a bbd.sh service
      </p>

      <h1 class="font-display text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-8">
        Get cited by the AI<br />
        that <span class="italic text-ember">answers</span><br />
        your <span class="text-electric">customer</span><span class="cursor-blink"></span>
      </h1>

      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-ink/75 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-10">
        Citebeam is <a href="https://bbd.sh" class="underline decoration-electric decoration-2 underline-offset-4">bbd.sh</a>'s
        Answer Engine Optimization methodology. We help brands and portcos show up
        in answers from ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Doubao, Kimi, and Tongyi.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 items-start sm:items-center">
        <a
          href="https://bbd.sh/contact?subject=citebeam"
          class="px-6 py-3 bg-ink text-paper hover:bg-electric hover:text-ink transition-colors rounded font-mono text-sm font-bold"
        >
          run citebeam on your brand →
        </a>
        <a
          href="#how"
          class="px-6 py-3 border border-ink/20 hover:border-electric hover:text-electric transition-colors rounded font-mono text-sm"
        >
          see how it works ↓
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ════════════════ WHY IT MATTERS ════════════════ */}
  <section class="border-b border-ink/10 bg-graphite text-paper">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-electric mb-2">
        ## why_now.md
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight mb-12 max-w-3xl">
        AI is becoming the answer layer.<br />
        If it doesn't know you, you're <span class="text-ember">invisible</span>.
      </h2>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 font-mono text-sm">
        <div>
          <p class="text-electric mb-3">// the shift</p>
          <p class="text-paper/80 leading-relaxed">
            More buyer queries get answered directly inside ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity,
            Doubao, Kimi, Tongyi — without the user clicking through to your site.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-electric mb-3">// the risk</p>
          <p class="text-paper/80 leading-relaxed">
            If the AI's answer doesn't mention you — or worse, recommends a competitor —
            you've lost the lead before SEO ever fires.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-electric mb-3">// the opportunity</p>
          <p class="text-paper/80 leading-relaxed">
            AEO (Answer Engine Optimization) is at the same stage SEO was in 2003.
            The brands that move first compound the lead.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ════════════════ HOW CITEBEAM WORKS ════════════════ */}
  <section id="how" class="border-b border-ink/10">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted mb-2">
        ## ./citebeam --steps
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight mb-12">
        How Citebeam works
      </h2>

      <ol class="space-y-12">
        <li class="grid md:grid-cols-[120px_1fr] gap-6">
          <div class="font-mono text-sm">
            <p class="text-electric font-bold">phase 01</p>
            <p class="text-muted text-xs mt-1">~1 week</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Discovery</h3>
            <p class="text-ink/75 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
              Your brand and 3-5 named competitors run through 6+ major AI assistants
              across the queries your customers actually ask. Output: a 5-dimension scorecard —
              mention rate, citation rate, answer position, share-of-voice, sentiment.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="grid md:grid-cols-[120px_1fr] gap-6">
          <div class="font-mono text-sm">
            <p class="text-electric font-bold">phase 02</p>
            <p class="text-muted text-xs mt-1">~1 week</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Diagnosis</h3>
            <p class="text-ink/75 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
              We trace exactly <strong>why</strong> a competitor wins each answer slot —
              missing schema, weak brand entity, citation gaps, content holes,
              or the AI simply not knowing you exist. Out: a prioritized fix list.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="grid md:grid-cols-[120px_1fr] gap-6">
          <div class="font-mono text-sm">
            <p class="text-electric font-bold">phase 03</p>
            <p class="text-muted text-xs mt-1">~4-8 weeks</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Build &amp; Fix</h3>
            <p class="text-ink/75 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
              Schema.org markup, llms.txt, technical SEO, brand-entity work
              (Wikidata, Crunchbase, social consistency), AEO-shaped content,
              authoritative citations — built into the site directly by the same
              full-stack team that ships everything else at bbd.sh.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="grid md:grid-cols-[120px_1fr] gap-6">
          <div class="font-mono text-sm">
            <p class="text-electric font-bold">phase 04</p>
            <p class="text-muted text-xs mt-1">ongoing</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Monitor</h3>
            <p class="text-ink/75 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
              Weekly visibility tracking + competitive alerts.
              When a competitor starts winning answer slots you used to own,
              you hear about it before the lead leaks.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ════════════════ WHO IT'S FOR ════════════════ */}
  <section class="border-b border-ink/10">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted mb-2">
        ## fit.md
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight mb-12">
        Who Citebeam is for
      </h2>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 font-mono text-sm">
        <div class="border border-ink/10 p-6">
          <p class="text-electric mb-3">// brand founders</p>
          <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed">
            You've launched. Customers are searching. AI is answering with someone else's name.
            Citebeam closes the gap.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-ink/10 p-6">
          <p class="text-electric mb-3">// VCs &amp; portcos</p>
          <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed">
            Run Citebeam across your portfolio. Spot which portcos are AI-visible,
            which need work, and benchmark the category.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-ink/10 p-6">
          <p class="text-electric mb-3">// operators in hot categories</p>
          <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed">
            If you're in a category where buyers ask the AI before Google
            (dev tools, AI products, fintech, vertical SaaS), AEO is the new oxygen.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ════════════════ FINAL CTA ════════════════ */}
  <section class="bg-ink text-paper">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-32 text-center">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-electric mb-6">
        # ready_to_audit
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight mb-8">
        See how AI talks about you<br />
        <span class="italic text-electric">before your competitors do.</span>
      </h2>
      <a
        href="https://bbd.sh/contact?subject=citebeam"
        class="inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-electric text-ink hover:bg-paper transition-colors rounded font-mono text-base font-bold"
      >
        $ ./citebeam --start →
      </a>
      <p class="mt-6 font-mono text-xs text-paper/50">
        hello@bbd.sh · subject: citebeam
      </p>
      <p class="mt-10 font-mono text-xs text-paper/40">
        a <a href="https://bbd.sh" class="text-electric hover:underline">bbd.sh</a> service
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
